    {
      "id": "ce43bc6654eba7a917b74ed44dd38e96128d7a03",
      "individual_note": false,
      "resolvable": true,
      "resolved": true,
      "notes": [
        {
          "id": 1379288662,
          "type": "DiscussionNote",
          "body": "can you look this warning ? (not sure if coming from this commit)\n\npacket-ssh.c:2075:13: warning: Potential leak of memory pointed to by 'bn_priv_ht' [unix.Malloc]",
          "author": {
            "id": 279822,
            "username": "alagoutte",
            "public_email": "",
            "name": "Alexis La Goutte",
            "state": "active",
            "locked": false,
            "avatar_url": "https://secure.gravatar.com/avatar/a15cba6417f4d1723eb56add7099bcfd8df373dc520577958b33c37915ef231b?s=80&d=identicon",
            "web_url": "https://gitlab.com/alagoutte"
          },
          "created_at": "2023-05-05T05:31:34.616Z",
          "updated_at": "2023-05-05T08:30:22.226Z",
          "system": false,
          "noteable_id": 218911597,
          "noteable_type": "MergeRequest",
          "project_id": 7898047,
          "resolvable": true,
          "resolved": true,
          "resolved_by": {
            "id": 14343997,
            "username": "Skrillor",
            "public_email": "fabian.baeumer@ruhr-uni-bochum.de",
            "name": "Fabian Bäumer",
            "state": "active",
            "locked": false,
            "avatar_url": "https://gitlab.com/uploads/-/system/user/avatar/14343997/avatar.png?v=1776801968",
            "web_url": "https://gitlab.com/Skrillor"
          },
          "resolved_at": "2023-05-05T08:30:41.348Z",
          "confidential": false,
          "internal": false,
          "imported": false,
          "imported_from": "none",
          "noteable_iid": 10403,
          "commands_changes": {}
        },
        {
          "id": 1379469899,
          "type": "DiscussionNote",
          "body": "I was able to determine the root cause of this warning. The `ssh_bignum * bn_priv_ht` is being allocated before the cookie hex string is being checked for validity. If the hex string is invalid, the function returns without adding `bn_priv_ht` to the hash table which is responsible for free'ing the memory whenever the entry is being removed from the hash table.\nI rearranged the lines such that `bn_priv_ht` will always be added to the hash table thus avoiding the memory leak here.\nThe issue is also present in the current master as it has been introduced in !10441 and !10465. If required I can cherry-pick the commit into a separate branch and create another MR.",
          "author": {
            "id": 14343997,
            "username": "Skrillor",
            "public_email": "fabian.baeumer@ruhr-uni-bochum.de",
            "name": "Fabian Bäumer",
            "state": "active",
            "locked": false,
            "avatar_url": "https://gitlab.com/uploads/-/system/user/avatar/14343997/avatar.png?v=1776801968",
            "web_url": "https://gitlab.com/Skrillor"
          },
          "created_at": "2023-05-05T08:30:22.110Z",
          "updated_at": "2023-05-05T08:30:22.110Z",
          "system": false,
          "noteable_id": 218911597,
